d": 7, "type": "PreviewAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.17.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAudio"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["# OmniVoice TTS\n\n  ## Auto-Download\n\n  **Models auto-download on first run** - no manual setup needed!\n\n  | Model | VRAM | Size |\n  |-------|------|------|\n  | OmniVoice (fp32) | ~8-12GB | ~4GB |\n  | OmniVoice-bf16 | ~4-6GB | ~2GB |\n  ---\n\n  ## Manual Download\n\n  | File | Size | Link |\n  |------|------|------|\n  | OmniVoice (Full fp32) | ~4GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice) |\n  | OmniVoice-bf16 | ~2GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/OmniVoice-bf16) |\n\n\n```\n  📂 ComfyUI/\n  ├── 📂 models/\n  │   ├── 📂 omnivoice/\n  │   │      ├── 📂 OmniVoice/\n  │   │      │      ├── config.json\n  │   │      │      └── model.safetensors\n  │   │      └── 📂 OmniVoice-bf16/\n  │   │             ├── config.json\n  │   │             └── model.safetensors\n  │   └── 📂 audio_encoders/\n  │          ├── 📂 openai_whisper-large-v3-turbo/\n  │          │      ├── config.json\n  │          │      └── model.safetensors\n  │          └── 📂 openai_whisper-medium/\n  │                 ├── config.json\n  │                 └── model.safetensors\n```\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Whisper ASR models (for auto-transcription)\n\n  | Model | VRAM | Link |\n  |-------|------|------|\n  | whisper-large-v3-turbo | ~1.5GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo) |\n  | whisper-large-v3 | ~3GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large-v3) |\n  | whisper-medium | ~1.5GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-medium) |\n  | whisper-small | ~0.5GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-small) |\n  | whisper-tiny | ~0.4GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-tiny) |\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Non-verbal expression tags:\n\n  `[laughter]` `[sigh]` `[sniff]` `[question-en]` `[question-ah]` `[question-oh]` `[question-ei]` `[question-yi]` `[surprise-ah]` `[surprise-oh]` `[surprise-wa]` `[surprise-yo]` `[dissatisfaction-hnn]` `[confirmation-en]`\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Voice design attributes (comma-separated):\n\n  | Category | Options |\n  |----------|---------|\n  | Gender | `male`, `female` |\n  | Age | `child`, `young`, `middle-aged`, `elderly` |\n  | Pitch | `very low pitch`, `low pitch`, `medium pitch`, `high pitch`, `very high pitch` |\n  | Style | `whisper` |\n  | English Accents | `american accent`, `british accent`, `australian accent`, `canadian accent`, `indian accent`, `irish accent`, `scottish accent`, `south african accent` |\n  | Chinese Dialects | `四川话`, `陕西话`, `广东话`, `东北话`, `山东话`, `河南话`, `上海话`, `闽南话`, `客家话` |\n\n  **Example:** `female, young, high pitch, british accent, whisper`\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Multi-speaker dialogue format:\n\n  [Speaker_1]: Hello, I'm speaker one.\n  [Speaker_2]: And I'm speaker two!\n  [Speaker_1]: Nice to meet you!\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Links\n\n  - Original [OmniVoice](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice)\n  - Models [OmniVoice](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice) / [OmniVoice-bf16](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/OmniVoice-bf16)\n  - Paper [arXiv:2604.00688](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.00688)\n  - Issues [Report Bug](https://github.com/saganaki22/ComfyUI-OmniVoice-TTS/issues)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "-", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [663.25439453125, 1276.1156005859375], "pos": [-433.7237854003906, 161.8598175048828], "id": 28, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 112], "pos": [1594.3292236328125, 1305.71826171875], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 11, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widg